														The following are raid ideas from different sources:<br />
<br />
Lower Guk (several ppl)<br />
<br />
Mistmoore ( me =D )  -- this mainly for the crested armor and the bard stuffs that drop off davissi<br />
GREAT XP to be had here btw! but things have to be VERY well coordinated as the mobs here have very high intelligence (AI) and ALWAYS send at least one of their mobs for help before engaging in combat<br />
<br />
and for the lower lvls in the guild::::::<br />
<br />
Befallen.  i dont know how many 8 15 ppl we have in the guild, but a group of 20-30 should be able to clean this place out.  the third lvl is tough as it is congested with coerced necromancers like in dalnir (just lvl15 20 instead of 30 40 lol)  and has some sks.  this would be a great raid tho for ppl of that lvl i think.  remember tho guys.... if u decide to raid this place... sow outside because its a dungeon =D (18% xp bonus here !!! )<br />
<br />
and one day i wanna raid rivervale =D<br />
<br />
bye everyone<br />
